<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent EPS view cut. [CORRECTED 16:07 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent EPS view cut. [CORRECTED 16:07 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it reduced its earnings estimate on Lucent Technologies Inc to $2.10 (Corrects from $4.40) per share from $2.05 (Corrects from $4.50) for 1997.</p>
<p>-- maintained the market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1-7/8 to 55-1/2.</p>
</text>
